{"id":2355,"date":"2024-09-19T12:36:12","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:36:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2355"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:49:36","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:49:36","slug":"christmas-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/christmas-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Christmas Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Christmas Gift Box Empty Styles Ready to Fill<\/h2>\n<p>Celebrate the festive season with packaging that adds joy and character. At <strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong>, we offer custom <strong>Christmas cardboard boxes<\/strong> designed to fit your holiday-themed gifts, treats, and surprises. Whether you&#8217;re packaging ornaments, baked goods, retail items, or keepsakes, our boxes are made to fit your needs.<\/p>\n<p>We specialize in <strong>Christmas cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong>, ensuring you get quality packaging with flexible customization, fast delivery, and affordable pricing. You can also order <strong>Christmas gift box empty<\/strong> options to fill with your items and decorations.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"378\"><strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"336\">Festive Designs in Christmas Cardboard Gift Boxes<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"378\"><strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"378\">Custom Printed for Holiday Branding<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"660\">Stand out during the busiest retail season of the year. Our Christmas cardboard gift boxes can be printed with custom artwork, brand logos, snowflakes, ribbons, or seasonal messages. Whether you want bold red boxes, rustic Kraft brown, or full-color prints, we\u2019ve got you covered.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"846\"><strong data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"668\">1.<\/strong> Add holiday themes to your boxes<br data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"704\" \/><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"710\">2.<\/strong> Print inside and outside surfaces<br data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"747\" \/><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"753\">3.<\/strong> Choose single-color or full-color artwork<br data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\" \/><strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"804\">4.<\/strong> Include promotional inserts or messages<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"887\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"887\">Made for Gifts, Keepsakes, and More<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"964\">Our boxes are designed to hold a wide range of festive products, including:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1153\"><strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"972\">1.<\/strong> Chocolates, candies, and baked goods<br data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1012\" \/><strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1018\">2.<\/strong> Clothing accessories, scarves, and socks<br data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1062\" \/><strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1068\">3.<\/strong> Gift sets, candles, and ornaments<br data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1105\" \/><strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1111\">4.<\/strong> Seasonal promotions and retail products<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1455\">If you also sell skincare sets, makeup kits, or fragrance collections, our festive packaging can easily complement items from our <strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1327\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cosmetic-and-Gift-Cardboard-Boxes\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1325\">Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> collection. These are often paired with seasonal designs to create ready-to-display gift kits or holiday-themed retail bundles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1622\">From <strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1497\">Christmas cardboard boxes empty<\/strong> to detailed printed designs, we can accommodate all packaging ideas and promotional requirements for your brand this season.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>No.<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Detailed Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">1<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Sizes<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom sizes available ranging from small gift boxes (e.g., 4x4x4 inches) to large hampers (e.g., 24x18x12 inches), with precise dimension tailoring to client specifications.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">2<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Materials<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">High-quality materials including corrugated board for strength, Kraft paper for eco-friendliness, White SBS for a smooth finish, and sturdy cardstock; all sourced sustainably.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">3<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Coating Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Multiple coating options such as Gloss for shine, Matte for elegance, and Spot UV for selective highlighting, enhancing the festive appeal and durability.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">4<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Printing Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Advanced printing techniques including full-color CMYK, Pantone Matching System (PMS) for brand colors, embossing for texture, foil stamping in gold or silver, and inside-outside printing for comprehensive design coverage.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">5<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Variety of box styles including Tuck End for easy assembly, Two-Piece for premium presentation, Gable for unique shapes, Mailer for shipping convenience, and Sleeve for added protection; all customizable per order.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">6<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Lid Types<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Diverse lid types such as fitted lids for secure closure, magnetic closures for premium feel, open tops for easy access, and specialized Christmas-themed lids designed for seasonal appeal.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">7<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Minimum Quantity<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Minimum order quantity starting at 100 units, suitable for small businesses and personal projects.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">8<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Maximum Capacity<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Maximum production capacity exceeding 500,000 units, catering to large-scale retailers and seasonal demand spikes.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">9<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Proof Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Proofing options include digital flat views for initial approval, 3D renderings for realistic visualization, and physical samples to ensure quality and design accuracy.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">10<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Typical turnaround time is 4 to 6 business days for standard orders, with rush production options available for urgent needs.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">11<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free nationwide shipping included with every order, ensuring cost-effective delivery.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">12<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Design Assistance<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Comprehensive design assistance provided free of charge, including layout help, artwork setup, and customization advice.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">13<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Use Cases<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Ideal for packaging gift sets, ornaments, baked goods, retail items, and keepsakes, making them versatile for various holiday uses.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">14<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Add-ons and Finishes<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Additional customization options such as die-cut windows for product visibility, embossed snowflake patterns for festive texture, gold and silver foil accents for luxury, and inserts or sleeves for added functionality.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">15<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Customization Level<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Complete customization available, allowing clients to select size, material, color, printing method, and structural design to perfectly match their branding and seasonal themes.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Creative Options for Every Holiday Packaging Need<\/h2>\n<h3>Boxes with Secure and Decorative Lids<\/h3>\n<p>Need festive boxes that are easy to open but secure for transport? Our <strong>Christmas cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong> are the right choice. These come with fitted or hinged lids, offering both protection and presentation.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keeps contents protected during shipping<\/li>\n<li>Ideal for retail shelf display<\/li>\n<li>Easy to open and re-close for gifting<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also choose from magnetic closure lids or slip sleeves for a more refined look.<\/p>\n<h3>Large and Small Sizes Available<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re sending a single ornament or a curated holiday hamper, we offer both small and <strong>large Christmas cardboard boxes<\/strong> to match your needs.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Small sizes for stocking stuffers or trinkets<\/li>\n<li>Medium sizes for bakery goods or product kits<\/li>\n<li>Large sizes for clothing, gift bundles, or decorations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Boxes can be ordered plain or fully printed. You can also add inserts to hold items in place.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"359\"><strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"321\">Why Order Christmas Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"359\">Save More on High-Volume Orders<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"564\">Ordering Christmas cardboard boxes wholesale means more value for your business during the holiday rush. You save on unit pricing, enjoy consistent packaging quality, and stay stocked through the season.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"710\">\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"598\">\n<p data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"598\">Cost-effective bulk pricing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"638\">\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"638\">Uniform packaging across all units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"674\">\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"674\">No need for last-minute orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"710\">\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"710\">Inventory planning made simple<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1068\">Whether you&#8217;re preparing holiday kits, gift bundles, or decorative displays, our boxes are designed to handle both presentation and protection. For premium holiday packaging with a stylish appearance, you can also explore our <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"968\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/fancy-cardboard-boxes\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"966\">Fancy Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> category, which offers creative structural options and elegant finishes perfect for festive themes.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1107\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1107\">Ideal for Businesses of All Sizes<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1215\">From home-based sellers to large-scale retailers, our wholesale packaging fits all festive business needs:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1243\">\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1243\">E-commerce gift shops<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1280\">\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1280\">Bakery and confectionery stores<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1319\">\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1319\">Holiday-themed subscription boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1348\">Craft and d\u00e9cor sellers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1461\">No matter the order size or product type, we make sure your holiday packaging delivers quality and consistency.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Custom Finishes and Add-Ons<\/h2>\n<h3>High-Quality Coatings and Design Elements<\/h3>\n<p>We offer finishing options to help your packaging shine\u2014literally and figuratively.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for a bright, polished look<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for a smooth, classic feel<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight festive text or artwork<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Additional features include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Die-cut windows for product preview<\/li>\n<li>Embossed snowflakes or brand names<\/li>\n<li>Gold and silver foil stamping<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These elements enhance visual appeal and create a memorable unboxing experience.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Place Your Order<\/h2>\n<h3>Simple Steps to Start Packaging Your Festive Line<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your desired box size and style<\/li>\n<li>Choose printing, coating, and lid options<\/li>\n<li>Upload artwork or request design help<\/li>\n<li>Review a free 3D mock-up or flat view<\/li>\n<li>Approve the final layout<\/li>\n<li>Receive your boxes on time with free shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Our team is available to support you throughout the order process.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom Christmas cardboard boxes with lids and without<\/li>\n<li>Custom sizes and styles, including large and small box options<\/li>\n<li>High-quality material and printing techniques<\/li>\n<li>Free design support and mock-ups<\/li>\n<li>Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV finish options<\/li>\n<li>Rush production available<\/li>\n<li>Bulk discounts and fast turnaround<\/li>\n<li>Free shipping across the country<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking for <strong>Christmas gift boxes with lids<\/strong>, <strong>Christmas cardboard boxes<\/strong>, or branded solutions for your seasonal items, we\u2019ve got the experience and service to help.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> Offers Christmas Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices. We offer various sizes and styles to fit your needs. Our boxes are made from high-quality materials and are perfect for packaging and storing your holiday decorations. We also offer custom printing options to add a personal touch to your boxes. Order Now!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2470,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[184],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2355","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Christmas Cardboard Boxes Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality Christmas cardboard boxes in various sizes and styles. Ideal for packaging and storing holiday decorations. Shop Now!\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/christmas-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Buy Christmas Cardboard Boxes Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"High-quality Christmas cardboard boxes in various sizes and styles. Ideal for packaging and storing holiday decorations. Shop Now!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/ch